{"seq":69,"slug":"inter-process-communication","title":"进程间通信","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"进程间通信\">进程间通信</h1><p>操作系统把每个进程关进自己的地址空间，这是保护，也是隔离。隔离换来了安全与稳定——一个进程崩溃不会拖垮邻居——代价却是：两个进程想交换一字节数据，都必须穿过内核这道关卡。进程间通信（IPC）研究的正是这道关卡上的全部机制：内核提供了哪些通道、每条通道的语义与代价、以及在真实系统里该如何取舍。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 把 IPC 拆成四章，按「从地基到收口」层层递进。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」先建立全局视野。它回答三个根问题：IPC 一共有哪几大类、为什么进程之间天然不能直接读写对方的内存、以及面对一个具体场景该凭什么挑选机制。这一章不深入任何单一技术，而是给出一张地图和一套权衡框架，让后面三章的每个机制都能在地图上找到坐标。</p>\n<p>第二章「消息式」进入第一类机制：数据以「一条条消息」的形式流动，内核负责缓冲与投递。管道是最古老也最常用的字节流通道；消息队列把通信单位从字节升级为带类型、带优先级的离散消息；信号则是极简的异步通知，只传递「发生了什么」而几乎不传数据。三者共享同一个内核中介的拷贝模型，但在粒度、方向与实时性上各走一端。</p>\n<p>第三章「共享式」转向另一种哲学：与其反复拷贝，不如让两个进程看见同一块物理内存。共享内存是延迟最低的 IPC，因为数据交换不再经过内核拷贝；内存映射文件把这套机制与文件系统打通，让磁盘内容与共享内存共用一套页表语义。但共享带来竞争，于是同步原语——信号量、互斥锁与底层的 futex——成为这一章不可分割的另一半：没有同步，共享内存只是一块随时会被踩坏的公共草地。</p>\n<p>第四章「网络与现代」负责收口。Unix 域套接字把网络编程的 socket 接口搬到本机，并附赠一个杀手锏：通过 SCM_RIGHTS 在进程间传递文件描述符。在它之上，本地 RPC、D-Bus 与 Android 的 binder 把裸通道封装成「调用远端对象的方法」的高层抽象。最后，io_uring 与 eventfd 代表了 IPC 的当代方向——用共享环形缓冲区消灭系统调用、用单一文件描述符统一事件通知。</p>\n<p>四章读完，你会得到的不只是 API 清单，而是一套判断力：给定延迟预算、数据规模、信任边界与可移植性要求，知道该把哪条通道铺在哪里。建议按章顺序阅读，因为后面每一章都默认你已经理解了前面建立的隔离模型与权衡语言。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ipc-overview","title":"IPC 概览与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/foundations/ipc-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"process-isolation","title":"进程隔离与地址空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/foundations/process-isolation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ipc-tradeoffs","title":"IPC 选型权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/foundations/ipc-tradeoffs"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"message-based","title":"消息式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/message-based","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pipes-fifos","title":"管道与命名管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/message-based/pipes-fifos"},{"seq":2,"slug":"message-queues-ipc","title":"System V 与 POSIX 消息队列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/message-based/message-queues-ipc"},{"seq":3,"slug":"signals","title":"信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/message-based/signals"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"shared-memory","title":"共享式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/shared-memory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-memory","title":"共享内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/shared-memory/shared-memory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-mapped-files","title":"内存映射文件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/shared-memory/memory-mapped-files"},{"seq":3,"slug":"synchronization-primitives","title":"信号量与互斥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/shared-memory/synchronization-primitives"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"networked","title":"网络与现代","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/networked","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unix-domain-sockets","title":"Unix 域套接字","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/networked/unix-domain-sockets"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rpc-mechanisms","title":"本地 RPC 与 D-Bus/binder","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/networked/rpc-mechanisms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-ipc","title":"现代 IPC：io_uring 与 eventfd","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/networked/modern-ipc"}]}]}